</tabletlandscape>
</respprops>
<possize>
<point>
<x>212</x>
<y>213</y>
</point>
<size>
<cx>607</cx>
<cy>217</cy>
</size>
</possize>
<cssclasses>hideMe a_text</cssclasses>
<opacity>100</opacity>
<html>span.text1768052Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1768052Font1&quot;  &gt;XIAFLEX has a Boxed Warning because of the risks of corporal rupture or other serious penile injury that can require urgent medical care. Serious complications include corporal rupture and penile hematoma and may require surgery to correct the complication. Penile fracture is associated with penile pain, a popping noise or popping sensation in the penis, sometimes described as &quot;snapping&quot; or &quot;cracking,&quot; and sometimes accompanied by sudden detumescence, and could be followed by swelling and/or bruising of the penis. Signs or symptoms that may reflect serious penile injury should be promptly evaluated to assess for corporal rupture or severe penile hematoma that may require surgical intervention. Because of these risks, XIAFLEX is available for the treatment of Peyronie&apos;s disease only through a Risk Evaluation and Mitigation Strategy (REMS) called the XIAFLEX REMS Program. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf2\cb1\ulc2 ;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql XIAFLEX has a Boxed Warning because of the risks of corporal rupture or other serious penile injury that can require urgent medical care. Serious complications include corporal rupture and penile hematoma and may require surgery &#x0A;to correct the complication. Penile fracture is associated with penile pain, a popping noise or popping sensation in the penis, sometimes described as &quot;snapping&quot; or &quot;cracking,&quot; and sometimes accompanied by sudden detumescence, and could be followed by &#x0A;swelling and/or bruising of the penis. Signs or symptoms that may reflect serious penile injury should be promptly evaluated to assess for corporal rupture or severe penile hematoma that may require surgical intervention. Because of these risks, XIAFLEX &#x0A;is available for the treatment of Peyronie&apos;s disease only through a Risk Evaluation and Mitigation Strategy (REMS) called the XIAFLEX REMS Program. \par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿XIAFLEX has a Boxed Warning because of the risks of corporal rupture or other serious penile injury that can require urgent medical care. Serious complications include corporal rupture and penile hematoma and may require surgery to correct the complication. Penile fracture is associated with penile pain, a popping noise or popping sensation in the penis, sometimes described as &quot;snapping&quot; or &quot;cracking,&quot; and sometimes accompanied by sudden detumescence, and could be followed by swelling and/or bruising of the penis. Signs or symptoms that may reflect serious penile injury should be promptly evaluated to assess for corporal rupture or severe penile hematoma that may require surgical intervention. Because of these risks, XIAFLEX is available for the treatment of Peyronie&apos;s disease only through a Risk Evaluation and Mitigation Strategy (REMS) called the XIAFLEX REMS Program. </raw>
<numoflines>11</numoflines>
<numpubbullets>0</numpubbullets>
<textpublishlang>Inherit</textpublishlang>
<marginsize>0</marginsize>
</text>
