<html>span.text1805358Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;span.text1805358Font2 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:bold;}&#x0A;span.text1805358Font3 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#0000ff; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:11px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805358Font1&quot;  &gt;Note that 2 needles are needed: 1 for reconstitution and 1 for injection. This is described further on the next page of the PI. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:11px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805358Font2&quot;  &gt;Please view the video clip on reconstitution of XIAFLEX &lt;/span &gt;&lt;a href=&quot;##Action 1836104&quot;  &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805358Font3&quot;  &gt;here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805358Font2&quot;  &gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805358Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}{\f2 \fnil Verdana;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf3\cb1\ulc3 Normal;}{\cs1\cf3\cb1\ulc3 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf3\cb1\ulc3 ;}{\s3\snext3\fs20\cf3\cb1\ulc3\sa120 +NXL_Table_Bullet;}{\cs4\f2\cf3\cb1\ulc3 +NXL_Table_Bullet Char;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\sa160\ql Note that 2 needles are needed: 1 for reconstitution and 1 for injection. This is described further on the next page of the PI. \par\b Please view the video clip on reconstitution of XIAFLEX {\field\fldlock{\*\fldinst MERGEFIELD \lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1\cf2\sshlink\ul &#x0A; HYPERLINK &quot;##Action 1836104&quot; }{\fldrslt\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1\cf2\sshlink\ul here}}.  \plain\f1\fs24\par\sa120\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿Note that 2 needles are needed: 1 for reconstitution and 1 for injection. This is described further on the next page of the PI. &#x0A;Please view the video clip on reconstitution of XIAFLEX here.  &#x0A;</raw>
