<marginsize>0</marginsize>
</text>
<text id="1805327" parent="1805321" visible="false" ontop="true" fixed="true" proportional="false" defaulttext="none" verticalscroll="true">
<name>ann_text</name>
<lastupdated>1769019315</lastupdated>
<respprops>
<tabletportrait>
<text>
<possize>
<size>
<cx>466</cx>
<cy>152</cy>
</size>
</possize>
</text>
</tabletportrait>
</respprops>
<possize>
<point>
<x>212</x>
<y>218</y>
</point>
<size>
<cx>611</cx>
<cy>208</cy>
</size>
</possize>
<cssclasses>hideMe a_text</cssclasses>
<opacity>100</opacity>
<html>span.text1805327Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:normal;}&#x0A;li.text1805327Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:normal;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805327Font1&quot;  &gt;A course of XIAFLEX consists of up to 4 treatment cycles. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;ul  style=&quot;list-style-position:outside;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1805327Font1&quot; data-bltIndnt=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;margin-left:15px;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:0px; list-style-image:url(&apos;images/text1805327SquareBulletFont7.png&apos;); padding-left:7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--{ &#x0A;data-bltIndnt:0&#x0A;} --&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805327Font1&quot;  &gt;Each treatment cycle consists of 2 XIAFLEX injections and a penile modeling procedure; each cycle can take up to 1 week. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1805327Font1&quot; data-bltIndnt=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;margin-left:15px;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:0px; list-style-image:url(&apos;images/text1805327SquareBulletFont7.png&apos;); padding-left:7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--{ &#x0A;data-bltIndnt:0&#x0A;} --&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805327Font1&quot;  &gt;The interval between each cycle is approximately 6 weeks. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/ul &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805327Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805327Font1&quot;  &gt;During this time, patients will be instructed to perform penile stretching and straightening activities at home. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805327Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805327Font1&quot;  &gt;The treatment course consists of a maximum of 8 injection procedures and 4 modeling procedures, or until patient&apos;s curvature deformity reaches 15 degrees or less. In addition to the in-office penile modeling procedure, patients are to perform penile modeling at home for 6 weeks after each treatment cycle. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805327Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805327Font1&quot;  &gt;This figure displays a potential treatment schedule for XIAFLEX for Peyronie&apos;s disease. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}{\f2 \fnil \fcharset2 Wingdings;}{\f3 \froman \fcharset2 Symbol;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf2\cb1\ulc2 ;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql A course of XIAFLEX consists of up to 4 treatment cycles. \par\pard\s0{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnhang\pnf2{\pntxtb \&apos;a7}}\fi-360\li360\sb120\ql Each treatment cycle consists of 2 XIAFLEX injections and a penile modeling procedure; each &#x0A;cycle can take up to 1 week. \par The interval between each cycle is approximately 6 weeks. \par\pard\s0\ql\par During this time, patients will be instructed to perform penile stretching and straightening activities at home. \par\par The treatment course &#x0A;consists of a maximum of 8 injection procedures and 4 modeling procedures, or until patient&apos;s curvature deformity reaches 15 degrees or less. In addition to the in-office penile modeling procedure, patients are to perform penile modeling at home for 6 &#x0A;weeks after each treatment cycle. \par\par This figure displays a potential treatment schedule for XIAFLEX for Peyronie&apos;s disease. \par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿A course of XIAFLEX consists of up to 4 treatment cycles. &#x0A;Each treatment cycle consists of 2 XIAFLEX injections and a penile modeling procedure; each cycle can take up to 1 week. &#x0A;The interval between each cycle is approximately 6 weeks. &#x0A;During this time, patients will be instructed to perform penile stretching and straightening activities at home. &#x0A;The treatment course consists of a maximum of 8 injection procedures and 4 modeling procedures, or until patient&apos;s curvature deformity reaches 15 degrees or less. In addition to the in-office penile modeling procedure, patients are to perform penile modeling at home for 6 weeks after each treatment cycle. &#x0A;This figure displays a potential treatment schedule for XIAFLEX for Peyronie&apos;s disease. </raw>
