</possize>
<cssclasses>hideMe a_text</cssclasses>
<opacity>100</opacity>
<html>span.text1805683Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;span.text1805683Font2 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:bold;}&#x0A;span.text1805683Font3 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#0000ff; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805683Font1&quot;  &gt;HCPs must enroll in and complete REMS training and be certified to administer XIAFLEX for Peyronie&apos;s disease. Healthcare sites must be certified with the REMS program and ensure that XIAFLEX is only dispensed for use by certified prescribers. &amp;nbsp;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805683Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805683Font1&quot;  &gt;Before injection, the treatment area must be identified and prepared as described in this section. &amp;nbsp;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805683Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805683Font2&quot;  &gt;Please view this video clip on treatment preparation &lt;/span &gt;&lt;a href=&quot;##Action 1836911&quot;  &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805683Font3&quot;  &gt;here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805683Font2&quot;  &gt;. &lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805683Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}{\f2 \fnil Verdana;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf3\cb1\ulc3 Normal;}{\cs1\cf3\cb1\ulc3 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf3\cb1\ulc3 ;}{\s3\snext3\fs20\cf3\cb1\ulc3\sa120 +NXL_Table_Bullet;}{\cs4\f2\cf3\cb1\ulc3 +NXL_Table_Bullet Char;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql HCPs must enroll in and complete REMS training and be certified to administer XIAFLEX for Peyronie&apos;s disease. Healthcare sites must be certified with the REMS program and ensure that XIAFLEX is only dispensed for use by certified &#x0A;prescribers.  \par\par Before injection, the treatment area must be identified and prepared as described in this section.  \par\par\b Please view this video clip on treatment preparation {\field\fldlock{\*\fldinst MERGEFIELD \lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1\cf2\sshlink\ul &#x0A; HYPERLINK &quot;##Action 1836911&quot; }{\fldrslt\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1\cf2\sshlink\ul here}}. \plain\f1\fs24\par\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿HCPs must enroll in and complete REMS training and be certified to administer XIAFLEX for Peyronie&apos;s disease. Healthcare sites must be certified with the REMS program and ensure that XIAFLEX is only dispensed for use by certified prescribers.  &#x0A;Before injection, the treatment area must be identified and prepared as described in this section.  &#x0A;Please view this video clip on treatment preparation here. &#x0A;</raw>
<numoflines>9</numoflines>
