<html>span.text1805880Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;span.text1805880Font2 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:bold;}&#x0A;span.text1805880Font3 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#0000ff; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline;}&#x0A;span.text1805880Font4 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#000000; font-weight:bold;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805880Font1&quot;  &gt;This section outlines the in-office penile modeling procedure, which, in conjunction with XIAFLEX, helps to reduce or improve curvature deformity and straighten the penile shaft. &amp;nbsp;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805880Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805880Font1&quot;  &gt;At a follow-up visit 1 to 3 days after the second injection of each treatment cycle, perform a penile modeling procedure (as described below) on the flaccid penis to stretch and elongate the treated plaque. HCPs should instruct patients on how to perform gentle daily, at-home penile modeling activities for 6 weeks following each treatment cycle. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805880Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805880Font2&quot;  &gt;Please view these video clips on in-office modeling and at-home modeling activities &lt;/span &gt;&lt;a href=&quot;##Action 1837307&quot;  &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805880Font3&quot;  &gt;here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805880Font4&quot;  &gt;. &lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1805880Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf3\cb1\ulc3 Normal;}{\cs1\cf3\cb1\ulc3 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf3\cb1\ulc3 ;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql This section outlines the in-office penile modeling procedure, which, in conjunction with XIAFLEX, helps to reduce or improve curvature deformity and straighten the penile shaft.  \par\par At a follow-up visit 1 to 3 days after &#x0A;the second injection of each treatment cycle, perform a penile modeling procedure (as described below) on the flaccid penis to stretch and elongate the treated plaque. HCPs should instruct patients on how to perform gentle daily, at-home penile modeling &#x0A;activities for 6 weeks following each treatment cycle. \par\par\b Please view these video clips on in\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 -\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 office modeling and at-home modeling activities \cf2\sshlink\ul{\field{\fldinst HYPERLINK &quot;##Action &#x0A;1837307&quot;}{\fldrslt here}}\cf3\sshlink0\ul0 . \plain\f1\fs24\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿This section outlines the in-office penile modeling procedure, which, in conjunction with XIAFLEX, helps to reduce or improve curvature deformity and straighten the penile shaft.  &#x0A;&#x0A;At a follow-up visit 1 to 3 days after the second injection of each treatment cycle, perform a penile modeling procedure (as described below) on the flaccid penis to stretch and elongate the treated plaque. HCPs should instruct patients on how to perform gentle daily, at-home penile modeling activities for 6 weeks following each treatment cycle. &#x0A;&#x0A;Please view these video clips on in-office modeling and at-home modeling activities here. </raw>
<numoflines>12</numoflines>
<numpubbullets>0</numpubbullets>
<textpublishlang>Inherit</textpublishlang>
