<name>Question 1</name>
<lastupdated>1767734413</lastupdated>
<questiontext>True or false? In addition to the in-office penile modeling procedure, patients should be instructed to self-perform penile modeling activities at home each day for the 6-week period following the HCP penile modeling visit of each treatment cycle.  </questiontext>
