<html>span.text1806193Font1 { font-size:21px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#000000; font-weight:bold;}&#x0A;span.text1806193Font2 { font-size:13px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#000000; font-style:italic;}&#x0A;span.text1806193Font3 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.192&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.192;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1806193Font1&quot;  &gt;Safety Note&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1806193Font2&quot;  &gt;Scroll for more information.&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1806193Font3&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql\cf2\fs32\b Safety Note\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1\line\fs20\b0\i Scroll for more information.\plain\f1\fs24\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿Safety Note&#x0F;Scroll for more information.</raw>
