g1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 XIAFLEX is contraindicated in patients with a history of hypersensitivity to XIAFLEX or to collagenase used in any other therapeutic application or application method; or in the treatment of Peyronie&apos;s &#x0A;plaques that involve the penile urethra due to potential risk to this structure. \plain\f1\fs24\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
