<html>span.text1806934Font1 { font-size:21px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#000000; font-weight:bold;}&#x0A;span.text1806934Font2 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;&lt;p  style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1806934Font1&quot;  &gt;Safety Note&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1806934Font2&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql\cf2\fs32\b Safety Note\plain\f1\fs24\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿Safety Note</raw>
<numoflines>1</numoflines>
<numpubbullets>0</numpubbullets>
<textpublishlang>Inherit</textpublishlang>
<marginsize>0</marginsize>
</text>
<text id="1806935" parent="1806929" visible="false" ontop="true" fixed="true" proportional="false" publishasimage="true" defaulttext="none">
<name>ann_text</name>
<lastupdated>1769699176</lastupdated>
<respprops>
<tabletportrait>
<text>
<possize>
<size>
<cx>460</cx>
<cy>162</cy>
</size>
</possize>
</text>
</tabletportrait>
</respprops>
<possize>
<point>
<x>212</x>
<y>213</y>
</point>
<size>
<cx>607</cx>
<cy>145</cy>
</size>
</possize>
<cssclasses>hideMe a_text</cssclasses>
<opacity>100</opacity>
<html>span.text1806935Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1806935Font1&quot;  &gt;Based on postmarketing experience, the PI contains Warnings and Precautions concerning the potential for acute post-injection back pain reactions. Note, this adverse event can occur after any treatment and not just the first treatment. This event may be mild to severe in intensity, and can radiate to the legs, arms, and chest. It may be accompanied by systemic symptoms, such as chest pain, headache, and dyspnea. These events are typically resolved within 15 minutes but may last as long as 30 minutes; one episode lasting 1.5 hours was reported. Observation and analgesic treatment may be required. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf2\cb1\ulc2 ;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 Based on postmarketing experience, the PI contains Warnings and Precautions concerning the potential for acute post-injection back pain reactions. Note, this adverse event can occur after any treatment &#x0A;and not just the first treatment. This event may be mild to severe in intensity, and can radiate to the legs, arms, and chest. It may be accompanied by systemic symptoms, such as chest pain, headache, and dyspnea. These events are typically resolved within &#x0A;15 minutes but may last as long as 30 minutes; one episode lasting 1.5 hours was reported. Observation and analgesic treatment may be required. \plain\f1\fs24\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿Based on postmarketing experience, the PI contains Warnings and Precautions concerning the potential for acute post-injection back pain reactions. Note, this adverse event can occur after any treatment and not just the first treatment. This event may be mild to severe in intensity, and can radiate to the legs, arms, and chest. It may be accompanied by systemic symptoms, such as chest pain, headache, and dyspnea. These events are typically resolved within 15 minutes but may last as long as 30 minutes; one episode lasting 1.5 hours was reported. Observation and analgesic treatment may be required. </raw>
<numoflines>8</numoflines>
<numpubbullets>0</numpubbullets>
<textpublishlang>Inherit</textpublishlang>
<marginsize>0</marginsize>
</text>
