<opacity>100</opacity>
<html>span.text1807968Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1807968Font1&quot;  &gt;This section points out specific products or substances that should not be used at the same time as one another, or whose use together poses unique risks or requires specific considerations or precautions. XIAFLEX should be used with caution in patients receiving concomitant anticoagulants (except for low-dose aspirin). &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf2\cb1\ulc2 ;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 This section points out specific products or substances that should not be used at the same time as one another, or whose use together poses unique risks or requires specific considerations or precautions. &#x0A;XIAFLEX should be used with caution in patients receiving concomitant anticoagulants (except for low-dose aspirin). \plain\f1\fs24\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿This section points out specific products or substances that should not be used at the same time as one another, or whose use together poses unique risks or requires specific considerations or precautions. XIAFLEX should be used with caution in patients receiving concomitant anticoagulants (except for low-dose aspirin). </raw>
