<html>span.text1809320Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;span.text1809320Font2 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-style:italic;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1809320Font1&quot;  &gt;Baseline characteristics of patients enrolled in Study 1 and Study 2 are shown in Table 9. Most patients were age 57 to 58 years old, with an average duration of Peyronie&apos;s disease between approximately 3.4 to 4.8 years. The mean penile curvature deformity ranged from 48.8 to 51.3 degrees, with a mean range patient-reported Peyronie&apos;s disease Bother domain score of 7.4 to 8.4. &lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1809320Font2&quot;  &gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1809320Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf2\cb1\ulc2 ;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql Baseline characteristics of patients enrolled in Study 1 and Study 2 are shown in Table 9. Most patients were age 57 to 58 years old, with an average duration of Peyronie&apos;s disease between approximately 3.4 to 4.8 years. The mean &#x0A;penile curvature deformity ranged from 48.8 to 51.3 degrees, with a mean range patient-reported Peyronie&apos;s disease Bother domain score of 7.4 to 8.4. \i  \plain\f1\fs24\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿Baseline characteristics of patients enrolled in Study 1 and Study 2 are shown in Table 9. Most patients were age 57 to 58 years old, with an average duration of Peyronie&apos;s disease between approximately 3.4 to 4.8 years. The mean penile curvature deformity ranged from 48.8 to 51.3 degrees, with a mean range patient-reported Peyronie&apos;s disease Bother domain score of 7.4 to 8.4.  </raw>
