</size>
</possize>
<cssclasses>hideMe a_text</cssclasses>
<opacity>100</opacity>
<html>span.text1809258Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1809258Font1&quot;  &gt;Before the first dose of study drug was administered, eligible patients were stratified by degree of erectile curvature deformity and then randomized (2:1) to receive either XIAFLEX or placebo. At week 52, efficacy was evaluated in a modified intent-to-treat population (mITT), which included those patients with erectile curvature deformity measurement and Peyronie&apos;s Disease Questionnaire (PDQ) assessment at baseline, and at 1 or more subsequent time points, and who had engaged in vaginal intercourse within 3 months prior to each PDQ assessment. &amp;nbsp;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1809258Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1809258Font1&quot;  &gt;Patient disposition is shown in the figure below.&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}{\f2 \fnil Verdana;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf2\cb1\ulc2 ;}{\s3\snext3\fs20\cf2\cb1\ulc2\sa120 +NXL_Table_Bullet;}{\cs4\f2\cf2\cb1\ulc2 +NXL_Table_Bullet Char;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 Before the first dose of study drug was administered, eligible patients were stratified by degree of erectile curvature deformity and then randomized (2:1) to receive either XIAFLEX or placebo. At week &#x0A;52, efficacy was evaluated in a modified intent-to-treat population (mITT), which included those patients with erectile curvature deformity measurement and Peyronie&apos;s Disease Questionnaire (PDQ) assessment at baseline, and at 1 or more subsequent time &#x0A;points, and who had engaged in vaginal intercourse within 3 months prior to each PDQ assessment.  \par\plain\f1\fs24\par\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 Patient disposition is shown in the figure below.\plain\f1\fs24\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿Before the first dose of study drug was administered, eligible patients were stratified by degree of erectile curvature deformity and then randomized (2:1) to receive either XIAFLEX or placebo. At week 52, efficacy was evaluated in a modified intent-to-treat population (mITT), which included those patients with erectile curvature deformity measurement and Peyronie&apos;s Disease Questionnaire (PDQ) assessment at baseline, and at 1 or more subsequent time points, and who had engaged in vaginal intercourse within 3 months prior to each PDQ assessment.  &#x0A;Patient disposition is shown in the figure below.</raw>
<numoflines>9</numoflines>
<numpubbullets>0</numpubbullets>
