<html>span.text1809466Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:normal;}&#x0A;li.text1809466Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:normal;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1809466Font1&quot;  &gt;In both Study 1 and Study 2, after up to 4 cycles of XIAFLEX, there was significant improvement in erectile curvature from baseline to week 52 for patients in the XIAFLEX group as compared to placebo. &amp;nbsp;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;ul  style=&quot;list-style-position:outside;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1809466Font1&quot; data-bltIndnt=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;margin-left:15px;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:0px; list-style-image:url(&apos;images/text1809466SquareBulletFont7.png&apos;); padding-left:7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--{ &#x0A;data-bltIndnt:0&#x0A;} --&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1809466Font1&quot;  &gt;In Study 1, the treatment difference when compared to placebo was âˆ’17.2% (95% confidence interval [CI]). &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1809466Font1&quot; data-bltIndnt=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;margin-left:15px;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:0px; list-style-image:url(&apos;images/text1809466SquareBulletFont7.png&apos;); padding-left:7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--{ &#x0A;data-bltIndnt:0&#x0A;} --&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1809466Font1&quot;  &gt;In Study 2, the treatment difference when compared to placebo was âˆ’11.4% (95% CI). &amp;nbsp;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/ul &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}{\f2 \froman \fcharset2 Symbol;}{\f3 \fnil \fcharset2 Wingdings;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf2\cb1\ulc2 ;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 In both Study 1 and Study 2, after up to 4 cycles of XIAFLEX, there was significant improvement in erectile curvature from baseline to week 52 for patients in the XIAFLEX group as compared to placebo.  \plain\f1\fs24\par\pard\s0{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnhang\pnf3{\pntxtb &#x0A;\&apos;a7}}\fi-360\li360\sb120\ql\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 In Study 1, the treatment difference when compared to placebo was \u8722 \&apos;3f17.2% (95% confidence interval [CI]). \plain\f1\fs24\par\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 In Study 2, the treatment difference when &#x0A;compared to placebo was \u8722 \&apos;3f11.4% (95% CI).  \plain\f1\fs24\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿In both Study 1 and Study 2, after up to 4 cycles of XIAFLEX, there was significant improvement in erectile curvature from baseline to week 52 for patients in the XIAFLEX group as compared to placebo.  &#x0A;In Study 1, the treatment difference when compared to placebo was −17.2% (95% confidence interval [CI]). &#x0A;In Study 2, the treatment difference when compared to placebo was −11.4% (95% CI).  </raw>
