<x>212</x>
<y>197</y>
</point>
<size>
<cx>612</cx>
<cy>244</cy>
</size>
</possize>
<cssclasses>hideMe a_text</cssclasses>
<opacity>100</opacity>
<html>span.text1832267Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:normal;}&#x0A;li.text1832267Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:normal;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1832267Font1&quot;  &gt;The XIAFLEX Medication Guide answers common questions patients may have about XIAFLEX. It includes examples of information that patients should share with their HCPs, information about receiving XIAFLEX, as well as risks and what patients can expect, all written in patient-friendly language. &amp;nbsp;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1832267Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1832267Font1&quot;  &gt;Medication Guides address issues that are specific to individual drugs and drug classes and contain FDA-approved information that can help patients avoid serious adverse events. The FDA requires that a Medication Guide be issued when: &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;ul  style=&quot;list-style-position:outside;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1832267Font1&quot; data-bltIndnt=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;margin-left:15px;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:0px; list-style-image:url(&apos;images/text1832267SquareBulletFont7.png&apos;); padding-left:7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--{ &#x0A;data-bltIndnt:0&#x0A;} --&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1832267Font1&quot;  &gt;Certain information is necessary to prevent serious adverse effects &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1832267Font1&quot; data-bltIndnt=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;margin-left:15px;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:0px; list-style-image:url(&apos;images/text1832267SquareBulletFont7.png&apos;); padding-left:7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--{ &#x0A;data-bltIndnt:0&#x0A;} --&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1832267Font1&quot;  &gt;Patient decision-making should be informed by details of a known serious side effect &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1832267Font1&quot; data-bltIndnt=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;margin-left:15px;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:0px; list-style-image:url(&apos;images/text1832267SquareBulletFont7.png&apos;); padding-left:7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--{ &#x0A;data-bltIndnt:0&#x0A;} --&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1832267Font1&quot;  &gt;Patient adherence to directions for use is essential to a product&apos;s effectiveness&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/ul &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}{\f2 \fnil \fcharset2 Wingdings;}{\f3 \froman \fcharset2 Symbol;}{\f4 \fnil Verdana;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf2\cb1\ulc2 ;}{\s3\snext3\fs20\cf2\cb1\ulc2\sa120 +NXL_Table_Bullet;}{\cs4\f4\cf2\cb1\ulc2 +NXL_Table_Bullet Char;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql The XIAFLEX Medication Guide answers common questions patients may have about XIAFLEX. It includes examples of information that patients should share with their HCPs, information about receiving XIAFLEX, as well as risks and what &#x0A;patients can expect, all written in patient-friendly language.  \par\par Medication Guides address issues that are specific to individual drugs and drug classes and contain FDA-approved information that can help patients avoid serious adverse events. &#x0A;The FDA requires that a Medication Guide be issued when: \par\pard\s0{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnhang\pnf2{\pntxtb \&apos;a7}}\fi-360\li360\sb120\ql Certain information is necessary to prevent serious adverse effects \par Patient decision-making should be informed by &#x0A;details of a known serious side effect \par Patient adherence to directions for use is essential to a product&apos;s effectiveness\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿The XIAFLEX Medication Guide answers common questions patients may have about XIAFLEX. It includes examples of information that patients should share with their HCPs, information about receiving XIAFLEX, as well as risks and what patients can expect, all written in patient-friendly language.  &#x0A;Medication Guides address issues that are specific to individual drugs and drug classes and contain FDA-approved information that can help patients avoid serious adverse events. The FDA requires that a Medication Guide be issued when: &#x0A;Certain information is necessary to prevent serious adverse effects &#x0A;Patient decision-making should be informed by details of a known serious side effect &#x0A;Patient adherence to directions for use is essential to a product&apos;s effectiveness</raw>
