<cssclasses></cssclasses>
<opacity>100</opacity>
<html>span.text637856Font3 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#000000;}&#x0A;span.text637856Font4 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#000000; font-weight:bold;}&#x0A;span.text637856Font5 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#000000;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:5px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text637856Font3&quot;  &gt;A variety of callout icons are located throughout the PI Explorer. Each icon must be clicked to reveal additional information in a pop-up window. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:24px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:11px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text637856Font4&quot;  &gt;Clinical Concept&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text637856Font5&quot;  &gt;: provides background clinical information explaining why a PI section may be important to an HCP &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:24px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:11px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text637856Font4&quot;  &gt;Key Point&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text637856Font5&quot;  &gt;: describes how to use information in the PI to support selling messages delivered in the field &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:24px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:11px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text637856Font4&quot;  &gt;Dosing Note&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text637856Font5&quot;  &gt;: provides more in-depth information on dosing of XIAFLEX that may be important to HCPs &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:24px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:11px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text637856Font4&quot;  &gt;Safety Note&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text637856Font5&quot;  &gt;: explains key safety information and highlights of XIAFLEX safety information&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text637856Font4&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:24px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:11px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text637856Font4&quot;  &gt;Core Message Support&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text637856Font5&quot;  &gt;: highlights information in the PI that supports XIAFLEX core messages for use in Peyronie&apos;s disease &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  style=&quot;margin-left:24px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:11px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text637856Font5&quot;  &gt;You &lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text637856Font4&quot;  &gt;must &lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text637856Font5&quot;  &gt;click on every icon before advancing to the next page.&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}{\f2 \fnil \fcharset2 Wingdings;}{\f3 \froman \fcharset2 Symbol;}{\f4 \fswiss \fcharset0 Arial;}{\f5 \fnil Verdana;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf2\cb1\ulc2 ;}{\s3\snext3\fs20\cf2\cb1\ulc2\sa60 &gt;NXL_Normal;}{\cs4\f5\cf2\cb1\ulc2 &gt;NXL_Normal Char;}{\s5\snext5\fs20\cf2\cb1\ulc2\tx360\fi-360\li360\sa80 &#x0A;`NXL_Bullet;}{\s6\snext5\fs20\cf2\cb1\ulc2\tx360\sa80 `NXL_Bullet_2;}{\cs7\f5\cf2\cb1\ulc2 `NXL_Bullet Char;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;{\*\listtable&#x0A;{\list\listtemplateid1515899650&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01\&apos;a7}{\levelnumbers}\f2\fs24}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01-}{\levelnumbers}\f3\fs24}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01\&apos;a7}{\levelnumbers}\f2\fs24}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01-}{\levelnumbers}\f3\fs24}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01\&apos;a7}{\levelnumbers}\f2\fs24}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01-}{\levelnumbers}\f3\fs24}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01\&apos;a7}{\levelnumbers}\f2\fs24}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01-}{\levelnumbers}\f3\fs24}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01\&apos;a7}{\levelnumbers}\f2\fs24}&#x0A;{\listname ;}\listid285888238&#x0A;}&#x0A;}&#x0A;{\*\listoverridetable}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\sa80\ql\hich\f4\loch\f4\cf2\ulc2 A variety of callout icons are located throughout the PI Explorer. Each icon must be clicked to reveal additional information in a pop-up window. \par\pard\s3\li360\sb160\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\plain\f1\fs24\hich\f4\loch\f4\cf2\ulc2\b &#x0A;Clinical Concept\b0 : provides background clinical information explaining why a PI section may be important to a\lang1033\hich\f4\loch\f4 n\lang1033\hich\f4\loch\f4  HCP \par\b Key Point\b0 : describes how to use information in the PI to support selling &#x0A;messages delivered in the field \par\b Dosing Note\b0 : provides more in-depth information on dosing of XIAFLEX that may be important to HCPs \par\b Safety Note\b0 : explains key safety information and highlights of XIAFLEX safety information\b\par Core &#x0A;Message Support\b0 : highlights information in the PI that supports XIAFLEX core messages for use in Peyronie&apos;s disease \par You \b must \b0 click on every icon before advancing to the next page.\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿A variety of callout icons are located throughout the PI Explorer. Each icon must be clicked to reveal additional information in a pop-up window. &#x0A;Clinical Concept: provides background clinical information explaining why a PI section may be important to an HCP &#x0A;Key Point: describes how to use information in the PI to support selling messages delivered in the field &#x0A;Dosing Note: provides more in-depth information on dosing of XIAFLEX that may be important to HCPs &#x0A;Safety Note: explains key safety information and highlights of XIAFLEX safety information&#x0A;Core Message Support: highlights information in the PI that supports XIAFLEX core messages for use in Peyronie&apos;s disease &#x0A;You must click on every icon before advancing to the next page.</raw>
<numoflines>13</numoflines>
<numpubbullets>0</numpubbullets>
